{
  "declaredLength": 2164,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "妳為何會追求強大呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B370BA4F5567038FFD6C425F3759275462FF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是為了自己。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 364,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F70BA4E8681EA5DF1300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我是為了守護沐淨，\n也為了守護大家，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n才會追求著強大。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211662F70BA4E865B888B776C906DE8FF0C000A4E5F70BA4E865B888B7759275BB6FF0C00100001BE00000A624D67038FFD6C4284575F375927300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "的確我還一直沒能打敗由紫。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "768478BA621190844E0076F46C9280FD6253655775317D2B300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但那樣的苦境會讓我變得更強。\n為什麼呢？因為我擁有信念。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 496,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F4690A36A23768482E6588367038B9362118B8A5F9766F45F373002000A70BA4EC09EBC5462FF1F56E070BA621164C167094FE15FF5300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要能夠超越由紫，\n我就能覺得自己不會輸給任何人。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n為了到達那樣的心境，我要一直戰鬥下去。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA898180FD59208D858D8A75317D2BFF0C000A62115C3180FD89BA5F9781EA5DF14E0D67038F387D664EFB4F554EBA300200100001BE00000A70BA4E865230905490A36A2376845FC35883FF0C621189814E0076F462309B254E0B53BB300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "妳純粹是為了自己而戰啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59B37D147CB9662F70BA4E8681EA5DF1800C6230554A300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "身為寶可夢訓練家，\n那樣的想法真的是正確的嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8EAB70BA5BF653EF59228A137DF45BB6FF0C000A90A36A23768460F36CD5771F7684662F6B6378BA768455CEFF1F00100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這邊這邊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019908A9019908A300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要把<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳拉進來，\n結束那兩個人的戰爭。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62118981628A00100003110000FF01014F6059B362C990324F86FF0C000A7D50675F90A35169500B4EBA76846230722D300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>在這裡。\n就用對戰來決定誰是正確的吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002010000005728901988E13002000A5C3175285C0D62304F866C7A5B9A8AB0662F6B6378BA76845427300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 912,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "要追求強大的話，\n比起話語還是對戰才實在吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "89818FFD6C425F37592776848A71FF0C000A6BD48D778A718A9E9084662F5C0D6230624D5BE657285427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！為了證明信念，\n和我一起跟正義社對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0170BA4E868B49660E4FE15FF5FF0C000A548C62114E008D778DDF6B637FA9793E5C0D62305427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1040,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我也希望來場比試！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62114E5F5E0C671B4F8658346BD48A66FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想回去，\n所以我想對戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F356DE53BBFF0C000A62404EE5621160F35C0D6230300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對戰吧！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1116,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D62305427FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有些經驗就只能藉由\n戰勝強大的對手來獲得。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E9B7D939A575C3153EA80FD85C97531000A623052DD5F37592776845C0D624B4F8673725F97300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "力，即是力量！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "529BFF0C5373662F529B91CFFF01FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳意外地優柔寡斷？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B3610F59165730512A67D45BE165B7FF1F00100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "力，即是正義！！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "529BFF0C5373662F6B637FA9FF01FF0100100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>！為了證明信念，\n和我一起跟正義社對戰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1288,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0170BA4E868B49660E4FE15FF5FF0C000A548C62114E008D778DDF6B637FA9793E5C0D62305427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "列陣兵！用超級進化伸張正義，\n獲得勝利吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "521796635175FF0175288D857D1A903253164F385F356B637FA9FF0C000A73725F9752DD52295427FF0100100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "水晶燈火靈……\n用超級進化打敗他們。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6C34667671C8706B974820262026000A75288D857D1A90325316625365574ED65011300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "該拿出我們的絕招了！\n毒藻龍！超級進化然後大幹一場吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8A7262FF51FA6211501176847D5562DB4E86FF01000A6BD285FB9F8DFF018D857D1A9032531671365F8C59275E794E0058345427FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001D>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了自己而戰，\n為了他人而戰。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8681EA5DF1800C6230FF0C000A70BA4E864ED64EBA800C6230300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "這兩者之間沒有什麼優劣。\n不，看來是不該分優劣的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1576,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "9019516980054E4B95936C9267094EC09EBC512A52A33002000A4E0DFF0C770B4F86662F4E0D8A725206512A52A37684300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是啊！我相信你透過守護他人\n而能夠到達的心境也一定很棒！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F554AFF01621176F84FE14F60900F904E5B888B774ED64EBA000A800C80FD59205230905476845FC358834E5F4E005B9A5F8868D2FF0100100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我非常感動。\n請妳一定要收下這個服裝。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211975E5E38611F52D53002000A8ACB59B34E005B9A898165364E0B9019500B670D88DD300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "在我從由紫手上獲得自由之前，\n我答應了要一直穿著現在的衣服。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1752,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "572862115F9E75317D2B624B4E0A73725F9781EA75314E4B524DFF0C000A62117B5461C94E8689814E0076F47A7F845773FE572876848863670D300200100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我知道了。\n那麼，這個服裝給<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1824,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621177E590534E863002000A90A39EBCFF0C9019500B670D88DD7D660010000201000000300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n另一種顏色的皙白裝扮道服組合！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A53E64E007A2E984F827276847699767D88DD626E9053670D7D445408FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然應該只是一時興起，\n但聽說還有人模仿像皙白那樣的髮型。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713661C98A7253EA662F4E00664282088D77FF0C000A4F46807D8AAA908467094EBA6A214EFF50CF7699767D90A36A2376849AEE578B300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "追求強大這件事是沒有止境的。\n有機會的話，我們再來比試吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FFD6C425F37592790194EF64E8B662F6C9267096B62588376843002000A67096A5F670376848A71FF0C62115011518D4F866BD48A665427300200100002011400110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一種見解是春紫比我\n更適合道場這個地方。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2056,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E007A2E898B89E3662F66257D2B6BD46211000A66F490695408905358349019500B573065B9300200100002011400120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我好像在小時候曾經和\n皙白用格鬥技對決過……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0016>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2108,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211597D50CF57285C0F6642501966FE7D93548C000A7699767D7528683C9B2562805C0D6C7A904E2026202600100002011400160000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    }
  ],
